Italy calls for release of five activists kidnapped by Israeli troops in West Bank 

Italy’s Foreign Minister Antonio Tajani has called for the quick and unconditional release of ​five Italian campaigners, all women, who were among dozens of activists kidnapped by Israeli forces during a mass abduction in the occupied West Bank earlier this week.

